    EditionNoticeTitle, EditionNoticeText, EditionSettings, SettingsEditionCheck, EditionSetupLine, DiagExportTitle,
    DiagExportHint, DiagExportSave, DiagExportFilter, DiagExportEmpty, DiagExportDone, SafeTitle, SafeAskText,
